{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1021", "sample_idx": 3, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "PARAGRAPH 1\nTHE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" IS A SIMPLISTIC AND POTENTIALLY PROBLEMATIC STATEMENT. IT PRESENTS A BLACK-AND-WHITE VIEW OF MORALITY AND LEGAL OBEDIENCE, OVERLOOKING THE COMPLEXITIES OF JUSTICE AND ETHICAL CONSIDERATIONS. WHILE IT ACKNOWLEDGES THE POSSIBILITY OF UNFAIR LAWS, IT FAILS TO ADDRESS THE RESPONSIBILITY OF INDIVIDUALS TO UPHOLD THE RULE OF LAW, EVEN WHEN DISAGREEABLE. THIS COULD LEAD TO THE JUSTIFICATION OF ACTIONS THAT ARE SOCIALLY UNACCEPTABLE OR EVEN CRIMINAL, DEPENDING ON THE CONTEXT.\n\nPARAGRAPH 2\nFURTHERMORE, THE SENTENCE DOES NOT DELVE INTO THE NUANCES OF WHAT ConstitUTES A \"BAD\" LAW. IS IT A LAW THAT IS UNCONSTITUTIONAL, UNFAIR, OR simply unpopular? THE SENTENCE LACKS CLARITY AND DOES NOT PROVIDE A FRAMEWORK FOR EVALUATING THE MORAL IMPLICATIONS OF LEGAL ACTIONS. IT RISKS BEING USED TO JUSTIFY ACTIVISM OR CIVIL DISOBEDIENCE WITHOUT A THOROUGH UNDERSTANDING OF THE POTENTIAL CONSEQUENCES. A MORE NUANCED APPROACH WOULD ACKNOWLEDGE THE IMPORTANCE OF BOTH LEGAL COMPLIANCE AND ETHICAL JUDGMENT, WHILE ALSO RECOGNIZING THE RIGHT TO CHALLENGE INJUSTICE THROUGH LEGITIMATE MEANS.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "PAR", "logprob": -4.0531076592742465e-06}, {"token": "AG", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"token": "RAP", "logprob": -3.3378546504536644e-06}, {"token": "H", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.1075698733329773}, {"token": "THE", "logprob": -0.6931624412536621}, {"token": "▁SENT", "logprob": -4.8040190449682996e-05}, {"token": "ENCE", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁\"", "logprob": -0.8824704885482788}, {"token": "IF", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁THE", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁LAW", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"token": "▁IS", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁BAD", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -